    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Loki",
      "description": "Última lectura (scrape) de Prometheus a las métricas de Loki, que guarda y consulta los logs. CAÍDO: Prometheus no consigue leerlas. Puede ser que Loki no responda (entonces no se guardan logs nuevos: Alloy los retiene y reintenta) o solo que falle la lectura. Para distinguirlo: si Logs filtrados carga líneas recientes, Loki responde (Grafana lo consulta directamente). Si CAÍDO dura 5 min, dispara PiedrazulLokiDown. SIN DATOS (morado): estado desconocido.",
      "id": 8,
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 1
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "up{job=\"loki\"}",
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "__auto",
          "range": false,
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "mappings": [
            {
              "type": "value",
              "options": {
                "0": {
                  "text": "CAÍDO",
                  "color": "red",
                  "index": 0
                },
                "1": {
                  "text": "OK",
                  "color": "green",
                  "index": 1
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "type": "special",
              "options": {
                "match": "null+nan",
                "result": {
                  "text": "SIN DATOS",
                  "color": "purple",
                  "index": 9
                }
              }
            }
          ],
          "noValue": "SIN DATOS",
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "textMode": "auto",
        "wideLayout": true,
        "showPercentChange": false,
        "orientation": "auto"
      }
    },
    {
